  "name": "BAM_VARIANT_CALLING_SOMATIC_ALL",
  "annotation": "Somatic variant calling workflow supporting multiple tools: ASCAT, ControlFreeC, CNVkit, FreeBayes, Manta, Strelka, MuSE, Mutect2, TNscope, TIDDIT, MSIsensorPro, and IndexCov. Tools are conditionally executed based on input parameters. Outputs include individual VCF files from each tool and combined VCF collection.",
